+| `/api/ingest/...` | `ingest:8080/...` | GET y POST |
+| `/api/analyzer/...` | `analyzer:8081/...` | solo GET (los eventos entran siempre por el ingest) |
+| `/api/prolog/...` | `prolog:8082/...` | GET y POST |
